### Get all trails

GET http://localhost:3001/api/trails


### Get user favorites

GET http://localhost:3001/api/user/favorites


### Add User Favorite

POST http://localhost:3001/api/user/favorites
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "20e2126b-7e81-490e-b8b5-4d941785b795",
  "added": "2024-06-05T12:00:00Z"
}


### Delete a Favorite

DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/user/favorites/b1c2d3e4-f5a6-7890-bcde-f1234567890

